<view class="package-events-page"><image class="package-events-bg" src="/images/runtime/team-data-emerald-stadium-v1.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="package-events-content"><view class="package-events-nav"><text class="package-events-back" bindtap="back">‹</text><text>赛事球员数据</text></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="package-events-loading">正在聚合本队授权数据…</view><block wx:else><view class="package-events-hero"><image src="{{team.logo}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text>{{team.name}}</text><text>✓ 球队数据包 · 已开通</text><text>所属赛事　{{tournament.name}}</text><text>组别　　　{{division.name}}</text></view></view><view class="package-events-metrics"><view><image src="/images/runtime/icons/brand-v2-16.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>{{summary.matchCount}}</text><text>比赛</text></view><view><image src="/images/icons/ball.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>{{summary.goals}}</text><text>进球</text></view><view><image src="/images/runtime/icons/brand-v2-15.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>{{summary.assists}}</text><text>助攻</text></view><view><image src="/images/runtime/icons/brand-v2-11.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>{{summary.appearancePlayers}}</text><text>出场球员</text></view></view><view class="package-events-card"><text>球员表现</text><view class="package-events-table-head"><text>球员</text><text>进球</text><text>助攻</text></view><view wx:for="{{topPlayers}}" wx:key="id" class="package-events-player"><image wx:if="{{item.photoUrl}}" src="{{item.photoUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text wx:else class="package-events-avatar">{{item.avatarText}}</text><view><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>ID：已脱敏</text></view><text>{{item.goalText}}</text><text>{{item.assistText}}</text></view><text class="package-events-all">查看全部球员　›</text></view><view wx:if="{{hasRecentMatch}}" class="package-events-card" bindtap="openMatch"><text>最近比赛</text><view class="package-events-score"><text>{{recentMatch.homeTeamName}}</text><text>{{recentMatch.homeScore}} : {{recentMatch.awayScore}}</text><text>{{recentMatch.awayTeamName}}</text></view><text class="package-events-match-meta">{{recentMatch.timeText}}</text></view><view class="package-events-card"><text>数据去向</text><text class="package-events-scope">✓ 赛事记录长期归入本队球员档案，可导出，后续可对接球队教务系统。</text><text class="package-events-scope">✓ 另一支球队是否开通互不影响。</text><view class="package-events-actions"><button bindtap="exportData" disabled="{{!canManage || exporting}}">导出本队数据</button><button wx:if="{{hasRecentMatch}}" bindtap="openMatch">查看比赛记录</button></view></view><text class="package-events-footnote">ⓘ 本页仅为球队数据包权益，不代表赛事已升级专业版。</text></block></view></view>
